      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/south_van_horn_alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community hosts many pipeline tool and welding supply businesses, making it a key industrial hub in the Fairbanks area.",
