      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/south_van_horn_alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A striking 54% of South Van Horn’s housing units are mobile homes, yet the neighborhood boasts a 97% homeownership rate.",
